BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (      From a game theory perspective:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (      - If I send nothing, I keep $5, receiver gets $0) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (      - If I send everything \($5\), receiver gets $15, and I get whatever they return) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (      - The rational selfish strategy for the receiver would be to return $0 \(since that maximiz) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (        es their payoff\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      - But if both players cooperate, we can maximize total welfare) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (      However, this is more complex because:) Tj ET
